      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這隻野生的火狐狸\n好像沒什麼精神呢……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901996BB91CE751F7684706B72D072F8000A597D50CF6C924EC09EBC7CBE795E54622026202600100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547C202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "給牠的食物也都不肯吃，\n帶牠去寶可夢中心也找不出原因……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D667260768498DF72694E5F90FD4E0D80AF5403FF0C000A5E36726053BB5BF653EF59224E2D5FC34E5F627E4E0D51FA539F56E02026202600100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中藥局！如果是以前在密阿雷\n開店的中藥局店長，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也許就會知道什麼藥對火狐狸有效。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D85E55C40FF015982679C662F4EE5524D57285BC6963F96F7000A958B5E9776844E2D85E55C405E979577FF0C00100001BE00000A4E5F8A315C31670377E590534EC09EBC85E55C0D706B72D072F867096548300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會看著火狐狸，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去問問中藥局的前店長吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116703770B8457706B72D072F8FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB554F554F4E2D85E55C407684524D5E9795775427300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "時髦咖啡館，\n中藥局的前店長是那裡的常客。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66429AE6549655619928FF0C000A4E2D85E55C407684524D5E979577662F90A388E176845E385BA2300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "時髦咖啡館，\n中藥局的前店長是那裡的常客。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "66429AE6549655619928FF0C000A4E2D85E55C407684524D5E979577662F90A388E176845E385BA2300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳找我有事嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3627E621167094E8B55CEFF1F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "您是中藥局的人嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60A8662F4E2D85E55C4076844EBA55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有隻不舒服的寶可夢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670996BB4E0D8212670D76845BF653EF59220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此……\n身體不適的火狐狸是吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B6420262026000A8EAB9AD44E0D90697684706B72D072F8662F54273002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火狐狸這種寶可夢吃下了小樹枝\n就會變得有精神，或心情平靜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B72D072F890197A2E5BF653EF592254034E0B4E865C0F6A39679D000A5C3167038B8A5F9767097CBE795EFF0C62165FC360C55E73975C3002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "尤其是活力小樹枝。\n只要一吃，牠就會立刻恢復了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C245176662F6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D3002000A53EA89814E005403FF0C72605C3167037ACB523B60625FA94E863002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但以前能採到活力小樹枝的地方\n現在變成了5號野生特區……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F464EE5524D80FD63A152306D3B529B5C0F6A39679D7684573065B9000A73FE57288B8A62104E860035865F91CE751F7279534020262026001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要一邊遭到寶可夢的攻擊，\n一邊尋找活力小樹枝，想必是件苦差事，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去找有著甜蜜香氣的小樹枝就對了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E00908A906D52305BF653EF59227684653B64CAFF0C000A4E00908A5C0B627E6D3B529B5C0F6A39679DFF0C60F35FC5662F4EF682E65DEE4E8BFF0C00100001BE00000A4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB627E67098457751C871C99996C2376845C0F6A39679D5C315C0D4E863002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在浦藍區的5號野生特區\n說不定就能採到活力小樹枝。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那是種有著甜蜜香氣的小樹枝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57286D6685CD534076840035865F91CE751F72795340000A8AAA4E0D5B9A5C3180FD63A152306D3B529B5C0F6A39679D300200100001BE00000A90A3662F7A2E67098457751C871C99996C2376845C0F6A39679D3002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有點乾扁了……\n看來這不是活力小樹枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67099EDE4E7E62414E8620262026000A770B4F8690194E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有著被啃過的痕跡……\n看來這不是活力小樹枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6709845788AB5543904E768475D58DE120262026000A770B4F8690194E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一小部分被折斷了……\n看來這不是活力小樹枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E005C0F90E8520688AB629865B74E8620262026000A770B4F8690194E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "已經一點都不柔韌了……\n看來這不是活力小樹枝。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5DF27D934E009EDE90FD4E0D67D497CC4E8620262026000A770B4F8690194E0D662F6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有著甜蜜的香氣……\n找到活力小樹枝了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67098457751C871C768499996C2320262026000A627E52306D3B529B5C0F6A39679D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回到沒精神的火狐狸那裡吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE52306C927CBE795E7684706B72D072F890A388E15427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "活力小樹枝……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n中藥局的前店長好厲害，\n能找到那東西的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也好厲害！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D2026202600100001BE01000A4E2D85E55C407684524D5E979577597D53B25BB3FF0C000A80FD627E523090A36771897F768400100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F597D53B25BB3FF0100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這就給火狐狸牠\n吃吃看吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B390195C317D66706B72D072F87260000A54035403770B5427300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>把活力小樹枝\n送給了火狐狸！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000628A6D3B529B5C0F6A39679D000A90017D664E86706B72D072F8FF0100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是太好了。\n火狐狸變得有精神了……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F592A597D4E863002000A706B72D072F88B8A5F9767097CBE795E4E8620262026FF0100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547CFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀哎呀，\n看樣子火狐狸牠喜歡上<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳就讓牠成為夥伴吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE544054CE5440FF0C000A770B6A235B50706B72D072F87260559C6B614E0A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E865462300200100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C318B937260621070BA59254F345427FF1F00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火呼～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "706B547CFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "捉到火狐狸了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63495230706B72D072F84E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要好好寶貝火狐狸喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981597D597D5BF68C9D706B72D072F85594300200100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "若要讓火狐狸成為夥伴，\n請先整理盒子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82E589818B93706B72D072F8621070BA59254F34FF0C000A8ACB51486574740676D25B5030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "火狐狸牠大概是感受到了\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳為牠付出的努力吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
